[Music]  have you ever thought about ordering a  lift by controlling your thoughts  nor had i until i met matiere krantz  chief technology officer at finnish  elevator maker connect  corner has partnered with tech firm  unseen to make a mind-controlled  elevator this  electroencephalogram headset measures  neurons activities of our brains and the  data will be processed by ai to make a  command but first you have to teach the  device to understand a thought pattern  such as playing an instrument which is  then used to command the elevator  i'm now going to be thinking about my  favorite hobby which is playing guitar  and i'll find out whether i can order a  lift by doing that  hold on  [Music]  and here it is  as such this kind of eeg technology is  sensing people's brain this is decades  of science but uh now what we have is  actually you can have this kind of  smaller size devices with the simple  sensors to measure your brain activity  at kona we design connected elevators  and you can connect all kinds of devices  from wheelchairs to your  telephones  and control your elevator and you can  even use uh your mind to bring the  elevator up and down and we hope that in  the future this is how we'll be  interacting with infrastructure  including the elevators in our buildings  corner wants to showcase what's possible  when the devices like elevators are  connected through this experiment  currently though it has no plans to  offer it to customers

